      "name": "Counterspell",
      "actions": "reaction",
      "category": "defensive",
      "text": "Trigger A creature casts a spell the eldritch emeritus has prepared.\n\n---\nEffect The emeritus expends a prepared spell to counter the triggering creature's casting of that same spell. The emeritus loses their spell slot as if they had cast the triggering spell. The emeritus then attempts to counteract the triggering spell."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Third Contingent Sequencer",
      "actions": "reaction",
      "category": "defensive",
      "text": "Frequency once per day\n\nTrigger A creature attacks or uses a spell or ability that would affect the eldritch emeritus\n\n---\nEffect A masterpiece of complex spellwork instantly takes shape, casting Fire Shield, Mislead, and Mountain Resilience on the eldritch emeritus, each as an 8th-rank arcane spell.",
      "frequency": {
        "max": 1,
        "per": "day"
      }
